&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Konrad is a global leader in AI and digital innovation consulting. We help the world’s top businesses and brands succeed in the AI era. We are dedicated to solving complex business problems for our global clients with creative, forward-thinking solutions and AI-enabled products. Our employees enjoy a culture built on innovation and a commitment to creating best-in-class, AI-driven digital products used by hundreds of millions of consumers around the world. We hire exceptionally smart, analytical, and hardworking people who are lifelong learners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Consultant on our Strategy team, you will work in a multifaceted role guiding global organizations as they embrace digital transformation and innovate for the AI era. Collaborating closely with our Design and Technology teams, you will tackle complex business problems by creating smart, intuitive, and human-centered experiences. You will take ownership of strategic project workstreams, identifying how emerging technologies like AI can be leveraged to build best-in-class digital products and reshape our clients&#39; capabilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide our clients and internal teams in understanding business models, goals, and competitive pressures, pinpointing where AI and emerging tech can materially change how they perform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the creation of AI-forward digital solutions and target-state operating models for a variety of clients and industries, contributing to AI strategy and product strategy work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze our clients&#39; business processes, critical success factors, and market standing through independent research and stakeholder interviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute deeply to our advisory work on digital transformation, shaping points of view on how AI is reshaping intelligent products, customer experiences, and competitive dynamics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate closely with our Design and Technology teams to bridge the gap between business strategy and elegant, human-centered user experiences, ensuring strategic alignment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate and lead segments of user experience design thinking workshops, technology architecture sessions, and project planning activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Structure and author high-impact presentations, documentation, Request for Proposal (RFP) responses, and other collateral to a standard expected by a senior audience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track the evolving AI, digital, and product innovation landscape, acting as a thought leader who shares insights that strengthen our internal expertise and client deliverables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in any discipline or equivalent professional experience; we hire from business, engineering, math, statistics, science, economics, and beyond, and prior consulting experience is not required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 2+ years of relevant professional experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A demonstrable passion for and deep understanding of great user experiences, product innovation, and the rapidly evolving AI technology landscape&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to independently structure complex, ambiguous business problems and communicate a clear, analytical point of view&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent writing competency and communication skills, with a professional presence suited for advising enterprise stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving ability, excellent attention to detail, and the capacity to manage multiple workstreams concurrently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A self-motivated individual with a constant desire to learn more about the latest technology trends&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to thrive in a highly collaborative team environment and take ownership of independent deliverables&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong comfort with presenting, workshop facilitation, and public speaking&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine enthusiasm for in-person work and collaboration; this role follows a hybrid model with four or more days per week in the office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel globally for client work as required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Perks and Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentorship Program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Socials, Outings &amp;amp; Retreats&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Culture of Learning &amp;amp; Development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive Health &amp;amp; Wellness Benefits Package&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Retirement Planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Working Hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from Home Flexibility&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Service Recognition Programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Konrad is committed to maintaining a diverse work environment and is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants, regardless of race, color, religion, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin, genetics, disability, age, or veteran status will receive consideration for employment. If you have any accessibility requirements or concerns regarding the hiring process or employment with us, please notify us so we can provide suitable accommodation.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;While we sincerely appreciate all applications, only those candidates selected for an interview will be contacted.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;
